# FOMO-CASCI(4,4)/6-31G* for ethylene, Gaussian smearing kT = 0.2 Eh
basis           6-31g*
method          rhf
fon             yes
fon_method      gaussian
fon_temperature 0.2
casci           yes
closed          6
active          4
cassinglets     3
castargetmult   1
charge          0
spinmult        1
gpus            1
coordinates     geom.xyz
